WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:00.767
♪♪

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.701
[cash register ding]

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.069
[ding]

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.337 line:0%
How much money
do you have on you?

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.139 line:0%
Twenty dollars.
What about you?

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.040 line:0%
Ten.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.307 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.742 line:0%
<i> I'm trying to live
 my dream.</i>

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:12.078 line:0%
I am preparing
for three auditions.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:13.012 line:0%
Back of the line.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.047 line:0%
I haven't even gotten
a writing job yet.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.516 line:0%
I've been taking on
a bunch of freelance jobs.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.718 line:0%
Hey, squirrel, trying
to buy some lemonade?

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.586 size:88% position:56% line:0%
<i> ♪ Money, money, money ♪</i>

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:22.789 line:0%
<i> ♪ Money makes the world
 go 'round ♪</i>

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:25.058 line:0%
I just need a money order
for ten dollars.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.292 line:0%
That'll be 20 dollars.

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:28.061 line:0%
I get a fee
because I have no money.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:28.995 line:0%
Yep.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.063 line:0%
So, you're charging people
for being poor?

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:30.763 line:0%
Next.

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:32.298 line:0%
<i> ♪ Money, money, money ♪</i>

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.167 line:0%
<i> Those boys really care
 about you, don't they?</i>

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.401 line:0%
Yeah, they do.

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.236 line:0%
'Cause you're my friends,
and I love you.

00:00:37.269 --> 00:00:39.105 line:0%
I just don't know if I'm doing
the right thing out here.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:40.273 line:0%
I'm just gonna keep working.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.808 line:0%
Yo, I got the part!

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:42.809 line:0%
Keep believing.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.110 line:0%
Just accept me
for who I am.

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.111 line:0%
<i> And we gonna make it.</i>

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:45.778 line:0%
[screams]

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:46.646 line:0%
Ah!

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.847 line:0%
I truly believe that.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.848 line:0%
I can see me now.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.349 line:0%
- What can you see?
- Me...

00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:51.617 line:0%
in the mirror
across the street.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.152 line:0%
What up, playboy?!

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:54.754 line:0%
<i> ♪ Money, money, money ♪</i>

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.323 line:0%
♪<i> Hate it when
 you're not around</i> ♪♪

